{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q3120528","formula":"BaU₃H₆Se₂O₁₇","hill":"BaH6O17Se2U3","elements":["H","O","Se","Ba","U"],"composition":{"H":6.0,"O":17.0,"U":3.0,"Ba":1.0,"Se":2.0},"names":{"en":"Guilleminite","uk":"Гійменіт"},"descriptions":{"en":"Guilleminite (Ba(UO2)3(SeO3)2(OH)4·3H2O) is a uranium mineral named by R. Pierrot, J. Toussaint, and T. Verbeek in 1965 in honor of Jean Claude Guillemin (1923–1994), a chemist and mineralogist. It is a rare uranium/selenium mineral found at the Musonoi Mine in the Katanga Province of the Democratic Republic of the Congo. This secondary mineral also includes barium in its structure, in addition to selenium and uranium.","uk":"Гійменіт – основний водний селеніт барію та уранілу – Ba[(UO2)3(OH)4(SeO3)2]*3H2O. Склад у % (з родов. Мюзонуа, Катанга, Демократична Республіка Конго): BaO – 10,8; UO3 – 64,5; SeO2 – 16,8; Н2О – 7,1. Сингонія ромбічна."},"fame":9,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3120528","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guilleminite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%93%D1%96%D0%B9%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%96%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guilleminite-Malachite-180973.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q416942","formula":"Pb₃(UO₂)₈O₈(OH)₆*3H₂O","names":{"en":"Curite","ru":"Кюрит","uk":"Кюрит"},"elements":["H","O","Pb","U"],"fame":17,"kind":null},{"id":"Q1146033","formula":"K₂Ca(UO₂)₇(PO₄)₄(OH)₆·6H₂O","names":{"en":"Yingjiangite"},"elements":["H","O","P","K","Ca","U"],"f